      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how painful it feels when this weight moves inside your chest as much as it does in this room, and I am so sorry you are struggling to breathe through it. Please stay with me for just a little while if you need, even the silence now can be a place to rest rather than a void that takes you. You do not have to carry everything alone tonight; I am here with you until the fog lifts off your mind. Please tell me how deeply you need support right now so we can find a way forward.",
