      "content": "The fog doesn't lift, Julian. It just gets thicker. I look at the shadows and I don't see a way forward anymore, I just see a way out. It feels so much more peaceful to just let go than to keep fighting this... this nothing. Doesn't it seem almost beautiful? To just stop everything and let the quiet be final?",
